# ADL Total Learning Architecture (TLA) — Foxxi composable ontology — version 2026.10.0
# https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/adl-tla  (this version: https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/adl-tla/2026.10.0)
